From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: NanoPi K1 Plus OpenWrt project <noreply@example.invalid>
Date: Wed, 17 Aug 2026 00:00:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] rtl8189es: v3 delayed inert — sleep 5 before exit

Hypothesis: 50_rtl-wifi executes during early boot and interrupts netifd
initialization (br-lan setup). By adding a 5-second delay before `exit 0`,
we let the network stack finish its first boot initialization before the
rtl8189es package script runs.

This isolates the "too fast" variable from the previous inert version that
was already刷了 and found eth0 dead after switching to DHCP.

---
 package/kernel/rtl8189es/files/50_rtl-wifi | 3 ++-
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/package/kernel/rtl8189es/files/50_rtl-wifi b/package/kernel/rtl8189es/files/50_rtl-wifi
index 222222222222..333333333333 100644
--- a/package/kernel/rtl8189es/files/50_rtl-wifi
+++ b/package/kernel/rtl8189es/files/50_rtl-wifi
@@ -1,5 +1,6 @@
 #!/bin/sh
 
+# Delay: let netifd finish first-boot br-lan initialization
+sleep 5
 # NanoPi K1 Plus relies on the shared wifi generator instead of package-local
 # rtl8189es boot mutations.
 exit 0
